{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"3d8759f51a63eeb6a360e87d1775f7e7900d1bcc28daef2d35962e25e17d2d17","digest":{"component_or_area":"transition command (txn.py, transition.py)","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/txn.py:197","src/rebar/_commands/transition.py:130-136","src/rebar/_commands/transition.py:293-294","transition_core","close_reason","--reason","--force","--force-close","--class","CLOSE_CLASSES","common.schema.json#/$defs/close_class","bug_close_reason_ok","ticket 723f-c5b2-d83b-43cb"],"problem_keywords":["flag honesty","discarded parameter","close_reason","undocumented behavior","transition command"],"propositions":["The --reason flag is advertised as available on every transition but is parsed and then discarded on plain close operations, misleading users into believing their rationale was recorded.","The close_reason parameter in transition_core() signature is never read in any function body, making it dead code across all call sites.","The --reason flag has meaningful effect only under --force paths (via force_reason logic), not on plain close, creating undocumented conditional behavior.","Passing --reason on a plain non-force close is silently accepted without documented effect, violating principle that invalid usage should be refused or documented.","The --reason flag scoping must be restricted to force paths only in documentation (transition.txt, transition.py usage) and implementation to match actual behavior."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787796089947356001,"uuid":"9ffc69b2-e8f9-44ec-b4c7-929e3705d524"}